{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "9a24e74e638b50ffaa73f1dc9abb88795480d842b744ee218be80c390e19f837", "ja": "暗雲を吹き飛ばせ！", "zh": "一扫阴霾吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "def914a375c5321ed6f225b6872a988e4737aef685dcc06490f58bc7b3f4a448", "ja": "黒井社長の妨害計画を阻止し、CD発売イベ\nントを成功させたメンバー達。現れた黒井社\n長に語った美希の言葉を聞いて、仲間への真\n剣な想いに胸打たれたプロデューサーは、後\nに控えたライブの成功を確信する。", "zh": "黑井社长的妨碍计划受到阻扰，\n成员们的CD发片活动成功落幕。\n美希对现身会场的黑井社长说出自己\n对伙伴的真心诚意，使制作人大为感动，\n并坚信接下来的演唱会一定会成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9693e79d11a5cd828a07fb8cefaef6b433cc1f5a05985432859f7974462c33ee", "ja": "（いよいよCDのリリースイベントが始まる。黒井社長\nの妨害があるだろうが……こっちも準備は万端だ！）", "zh": "（CD的发片活动终于要开始了。\n黑井社长八成会来碍事……但我们也做了万全的准备！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "683654d8078c88f5d33a4b2a372f1ec42615701388d3f712eb52e842ba618d64", "ja": "うふふ♪　それでは天空騎士団のみなさん、\nよろしくお願いしますね～？", "zh": "呵呵♪那么，天空骑士团的各位，\n麻烦你们啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1002_tenkuseiei", "source_sha256": "fde385285fec26c854a21c6076c71da97449278a67785177e46f595704dff51c", "ja": "ザッ！（敬礼）", "zh": "唰！（敬礼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "697433cb27eb18344a9b95caea03681473b935d8d22124802a20a9a10064ceb8", "ja": "すみません。体力的に選りすぐりの精鋭部隊とはいえ、\nファンの方々に、こんなことを頼んでしまって……。", "zh": "不好意思，虽说各位是体力方面精挑细选的精锐部队，\n但实在不应该拜托粉丝们帮忙做这种事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1004_tenkuseiei", "source_sha256": "fde385285fec26c854a21c6076c71da97449278a67785177e46f595704dff51c", "ja": "ザッ！（敬礼）", "zh": "唰！（敬礼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "7b8be7fccf204cef747bf31908356ac2182f69ceb021bbf3bb3ccb11c7716d9a", "ja": "気にすることはありませんよ～。みなさんは、聖母の役\nに立つことを、至上の喜びとしてくれていますから～。", "zh": "不用在意喔～能为圣母尽一份力，\n对他们来说是至高无上的喜悦呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "47c5791185789b5290155bced65bba11a7bc97fdc40e33096e0abdbb4a84ea24", "ja": "そ、そうなのか。あらためて、朋花のファ……\n騎士団の皆さんは、なんというか……すごいな……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？我重新认识到，朋花的粉……\n我是说骑士团的各位，该怎么说呢……都很了不起呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "df81ee980f31ff46cf41022f127846fe9b59855354c4cf629b69cb83b2c2fed0", "ja": "みなさん、ご協力感謝いたしますわ。\n{$P$}も、お願いしますわね？", "zh": "谢谢各位的协助。\n{$P$}，也要麻烦你啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0d894132117bce086ca9818d3893246ca8e810192610aa7884732200cc804d67", "ja": "ええ、任せてください……なあ美希、黒井社長は、\n会場に手下を潜ませてるんだよな？", "zh": "好，请交给我吧……我说美希，\n你说黑井社长会派手下混进会场，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "9e78da4981f6e5ceae94963dd835e9e354ae7a600704c73ab014a1129ea33afe", "ja": "うん、そう言ってたの。", "zh": "嗯，他是这么说的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "995149fde959c984cb394042710668470525e24d427f65f7c41bea0c8ecd8527", "ja": "なら、俺と騎士団のみなさんで対処するから、\nみんなは締めのライブに集中してくれ。", "zh": "好，那我和骑士团的成员会处理，\n你们专注在最后的演唱会上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "4a9ccafc47be1845b191381bdbeb792cedabc40b4a823c63e27776cfb732bf41", "ja": "わかりました！　ファンのみんなに、\n喜んで欲しいから……精一杯、頑張ってきます！", "zh": "知道了！我们希望粉丝们能看得开心……\n所以会尽全力加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "0a6553bea214713ecf8f87e27a85ce0e7de1167c738ebd00211afdf8e386e0c6", "ja": "うん、任せてっ！\nオレ達、絶対負けないから！", "zh": "嗯，包在我们身上！\n我们绝对不会输的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1013_staff", "source_sha256": "8eb000c3112947ff05491a0e98da45c8c90529c0c802b9d5d012d7d29661a747", "ja": "すみませーん！\nそろそろスタンバイお願いしまーす。", "zh": "不好意思──！\n各位，差不多该上场了──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "43c515a3c2d59b023832b7c00056f9016de38c803d555de84247487f992f9df8", "ja": "よし、準備はいいな！\nみんな、最高のライブを期待してるぞ！", "zh": "好，大家都准备好了吧？\n我会期待你们带来精彩的演唱会喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "6b206f242367effc8a10319d87dd2e6ec5a09519a279c13cb5021f9534015c6d", "ja": "みなさん！　今日は私達のイベントに\n来てくれて、ありがとうございますっ！", "zh": "大家好！谢谢你们今天\n来参加我们的活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8e490844e65761fbfa258ed3b2a4a99f3fc216f7c1d19f56ad7507ab45afd4a6", "ja": "（順調にイベントが始まったな。さて、後は\nいつ黒井社長の手下が仕掛けてくるかだけど……）", "zh": "（活动顺利开始了。\n好，接下来就看黑井社长的手下何时会出手了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1017_toorisugari", "source_sha256": "6ab6039febb49fb941f749b46fb6e9a36717a346b2116ae3e2db012f7947b6c1", "ja": "お、イベントをやってやがる。\nおい、漫才やれ、漫才！", "zh": "喔！居然在办活动。\n喂！快讲相声啊！相声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "71d13eec07df9aa430aa1f3a305ce376cfef2ef35c805caa9bb430311460b9ed", "ja": "ま、漫才と言われましても……。", "zh": "本、本小姐不会说相声啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "91304fc6001b85607b147b53586f3ea5627aa74b5e4540dc6c89f163be94e0d7", "ja": "（あの無茶ぶりは……黒井社長の手下か！\n騎士団の皆さん、よろしくお願いします！）", "zh": "（那种胡乱的要求……他是黑井社长的手下吗！？\n骑士团的各位，麻烦你们了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1020_tenkuseiei", "source_sha256": "1e9e9ec6c58af7898b7a4640650c430756d8774ccddb0877af97d7e488f7cbd7", "ja": "ザッ！（高速移動）", "zh": "唰！（快速移动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1021_kuroitesita", "source_sha256": "09900e55df861c532568ce02773d325cdc973858cc0c5e5a42baf0a34770ae02", "ja": "おい、無視するなよ！　早く漫才をって……\nなんだお前ら！？　うわああああー！", "zh": "喂！别忽视我啊！快点讲相声，等等……\n你们是谁啊！？呜哇啊啊啊啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "1f20da7c884a73b7e01f6d6134ed9de5c2ec57b10ec016fff548e5007ff88d47", "ja": "うふふ、騎士団のみなさん、よくやりました～♪", "zh": "呵呵，骑士团的各位，做得非常好～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "a26f59b9dd4ebd66d51d3ebb6d112b5914674754db519c960461ef368e8f84b7", "ja": "すっげー！　天空騎士団のみんなが、\n黒井のオッサンの手下を抱えて行っちゃったよ！", "zh": "好强喔～！天空骑士团的那些人\n把黑井大叔的手下扛走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "beeebcae61292b36e9e4b8c8f4178b6266d4e519a39bfb6e1ceb43d44bc9b173", "ja": "このまま{$P$}さんの合図どおりに、\nいい子で動いてくださいね～♪", "zh": "就这样听从{$P$}先生的指示，\n乖乖行动吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "de24d33809253f1274d8f2b3f7d9f9a7259ad18b20d61baa4313dbc0b0695bcc", "ja": "助かります！　よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "谢谢你们！麻烦各位了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1026_tenkuseiei", "source_sha256": "fde385285fec26c854a21c6076c71da97449278a67785177e46f595704dff51c", "ja": "ザッ！（敬礼）", "zh": "唰！（敬礼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7bea3b7b67b90788e4c963cb48f99f7253053a7aafd95e6c463571e385b6a20d", "ja": "（その後、黒井社長の手下と思われる人物は、\n次々に俺が目星をつけ……）", "zh": "（之后，我接二连三地指出\n疑似是黑井社长手下的人物……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1028_toorisugari", "source_sha256": "6fc3b976eec40531c8eaec7cfa415065ee4b9d7f3a3058b6864146a83a317261", "ja": "なんなんだ、このライブは！\n漫才が無理ならかくし芸でもしたらどうだあ～？", "zh": "这是什么演唱会！？\n不讲相声的话，那就秀几招特殊才艺来看看啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1029_tenkuseiei", "source_sha256": "1e9e9ec6c58af7898b7a4640650c430756d8774ccddb0877af97d7e488f7cbd7", "ja": "ザッ！（高速移動）", "zh": "唰！（快速移动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1030_kuroitesita", "source_sha256": "e01cf5143f2b8e12aae4929a9c386f25aec93e5d702b2d8c4ec365d97ccc1128", "ja": "早くかくし芸をって……\nな、なんだこの筋肉たちは！？　うわああああー！", "zh": "赶快表演才艺啊……\n这、这些肌肉男是哪来的！？呜哇啊啊啊啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1031_toorisugari", "source_sha256": "db80d535e26819f927b60a5df7b85e3d703a29f1a9e6b956b14bc25c46ca8183", "ja": "へいへい、歌とか踊りとかはいいんだよ！\n宴会芸でも見せてくれよ～、へいへーい！", "zh": "欸欸！不要唱歌跳舞啦！\n来点即兴表演啊～欸欸～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1032_tenkuseiei", "source_sha256": "1e9e9ec6c58af7898b7a4640650c430756d8774ccddb0877af97d7e488f7cbd7", "ja": "ザッ！（高速移動）", "zh": "唰！（快速移动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1033_kuroitesita", "source_sha256": "4259a29c70bdf7b6f63862f2b2a463c528b6aa85266d5c2b895ccb399fc71004", "ja": "宴会芸がムリなら、もっとさあ、こう……\nひっ、なんだお前ら！？　なんで鎧を……うわあああ！", "zh": "即兴表演不行的话，那就来点更那个的……\n哇！你们是什么人！？为什么穿盔甲……呜哇啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "3e6fbe1feae6458a6fe64437e854a80fb0116a051c3965386e36bf9707159e1e", "ja": "（イベント序盤のうちに、\n黒井社長の手下を一掃することに成功した！）", "zh": "（活动才刚开始，\n就已经成功扫荡黑井社长的手下了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1035_kuroi", "source_sha256": "2463b4051e26f993956a68d671f78cdb74b58725024c95f389aaa88de89f6889", "ja": "馬鹿な……！　私の手下は一体どこへ消えたんだ！？\nお、おのれぇ～！！", "zh": "怎么可能……！我的手下究竟消失到哪里去了！？\n可、可恶～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1036_047sub", "source_sha256": "8b46ffdde204f603baa9e435682a71c4809ef6b2f475e541987af51e6f637253", "ja": "へへっ、やったぜ！\nリリースイベント、大盛り上がりだったな♪", "zh": "嘿嘿！太好啦！\n发片活动的气氛非常热烈呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1037_038chz", "source_sha256": "4ac6356fa01256e0d850f00c9e8158330c5bcfaa4f7f3ae06fe2ee0828e21599", "ja": "ええ、これも朋花と、天空騎士団のみなさんの\nおかげですわね！", "zh": "是啊，这都要感谢朋花和\n天空骑士团的各位呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1038_031tom", "source_sha256": "93ed35545cf84a8df96d11a7f361be095df9cc67f3309fb84be290011038b7b9", "ja": "それから、{$P$}さんのおかげです。\nなかなか的確な指示でしたね～♪", "zh": "还有{$P$}先生的协助。\n你的指示十分准确喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1039_p", "source_sha256": "1e5f43ffc3707bb6452673f3bdbc982b6f9f3a38d0005b336e6868a89c97fd31", "ja": "まあ、リリースイベントに来るようなファンが、\nアイドルをおとしめるはずないからな……ん？", "zh": "毕竟会来参加发片活动的粉丝\n不可能会给偶像难堪啊……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1040_tenkuseiei", "source_sha256": "f79b354f8c11319d414e9b4761415250e7b202c1ffc0b28c43e27c9d391dc905", "ja": "ザッザッザ！（移動）", "zh": "唰唰唰！（移动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1041_kuroi", "source_sha256": "78ba1b35d318060d92784904274484b615fa2fcb37767dff54e9a1902b076677", "ja": "ええい、何だお前たちは、放せ！　いくら高貴だからと\nいって、この私を神輿のように担ぐんじゃあない！", "zh": "可恶，你们是什么人？放开我！\n我是很高贵没错，但别把我像神轿一样抬起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1042_003mik", "source_sha256": "0b7a9006d836044ddb74ac64515f86c2481a0d63d70485f230db2eea8a02fe43", "ja": "あ、黒井社長なの。", "zh": "啊，是黑井社长唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1043_kuroi", "source_sha256": "43859bd2051dd5c64c44ff98c45d8caed43dbc044e540815c9fa55aacac8a172", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……おお、美希ちゃんじゃないか！　一体\nどうしたんだ！　君は961プロに来るはずだろう？", "zh": "呼、呼……喔喔，这不是美希吗！\n到底是怎么回事！你不是要跳槽到961艺能吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1044_kuroi", "source_sha256": "0a41f267e67a16f6779834e8d788e90388455d450d2cc9e02c995d1cb1045fab", "ja": "まさか……君が手下達のことを教えたのか？\nくっ、なぜだ！　なぜ、私を裏切ったんだ……！", "zh": "该不会……是你告诉他们我派了手下进来吗？\n可恶！为什么！为什么你要背叛我……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1045_003mik", "source_sha256": "4217cbf4c154962dc784b7b27c9013955d45915e0f3e7ae42df552a4152f7db2", "ja": "ウソをついたことはごめんなさい。\nでも、ミキは765プロのミキだから。", "zh": "对不起，说谎骗了你。\n不过，美希是765艺能的美希啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1046_kuroi", "source_sha256": "41eac93bb252d2b62ebfd857026f8302e3415a5c1486a9f8d543a81e6249d5e1", "ja": "全くわからん！　765プロのようなセコい事務所より\n961プロに来る方が、君の、いや、世界のためだぞ！", "zh": "莫名其妙！与其待在765艺能那种寒酸事务所，\n不如来我们961艺能，这样对你……不，对全世界都更好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1047_003mik", "source_sha256": "dfd77ed60c7678f1870031e020c648d55a12c63e9abc49aa1b5f0272bdf7e541", "ja": "別にミキ、世界なんてどうでもいいの。", "zh": "但是，美希觉得世界变成怎样都无所谓唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1048_kuroi", "source_sha256": "848df1250ef01a64aec33aa824be2ef6660c15c348c67d92d4c5eab2ed4786e6", "ja": "何っ！？", "zh": "什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1049_003mik", "source_sha256": "23bd5fd3553cdbf63222a35730bb8e2103da2dfbe5f47142daedd71095a4b5de", "ja": "ミキはね、元気な昴くんが好き。優しい千鶴が好き。\nファン思いの朋花が好き。一生懸命な紗代子が好き。", "zh": "美希呀，喜欢活泼的阿昴，喜欢温柔的千鹤，\n喜欢为粉丝着想的朋花，喜欢努力打拚的纱代子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1050_003mik", "source_sha256": "06262ce0a431c97738c70cbdc7b599a981f8286842214115265fb5e476565199", "ja": "{$P$}が、だーい好き！", "zh": "也非～常喜欢{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1051_003mik", "source_sha256": "1005f51d7f93e314198ed76a7041b3f8364e796267f7489cd466ab2da51d5246", "ja": "765プロにはミキの大好きがいーっぱい詰まってる。\nミキはみんなと一緒にずっとアイドルしていきたいの！", "zh": "765艺能有好～多美希喜欢的事物。\n美希想永远和大家一起当偶像唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1056_p", "source_sha256": "6924805f73d8f95ae6c519aa51b0e76e8bcc66941958afc87614bf027cf820ce", "ja": "美希……。", "zh": "美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1057_003mik", "source_sha256": "f938c5fafe35bc80515b4d78b87ca7c43f6b4c627650c34ee26ae72e448ac5e6", "ja": "だから、みんなの悪口は言わないでほしいし、\nもうミキ達のジャマしないでって思うな。", "zh": "所以，美希觉得，希望你别再说大家的坏话，\n不要再妨碍美希我们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1058_p", "source_sha256": "d7544b076a9791129bccdc3f6d5b165031352ddeb881a4db7d6b86a6adc9b37b", "ja": "……黒井社長、そういうことです。\n今日のところは、お引き取りください。", "zh": "……黑井社长，就像她说的一样。\n今天就请你回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1059_kuroi", "source_sha256": "f0a540726648b543134ea0dea059380b634d7735f596f9e010183a08bbf6ba75", "ja": "む、むむむ～！　……ええい、もういい！\n貴様のような凡俗を相手にするのは、時間の無駄だ！", "zh": "唔、唔唔唔……可恶，够了！\n和你们这些凡夫俗子来往，根本是浪费我的时间！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1060_kuroi", "source_sha256": "b11ef8c18ecfa1ff7e508a72d8563f6e8b8a7de9cda0eb8faf56938a84708460", "ja": "ユニット公演でもなんでも好きにするがいい。\n私は失礼する！", "zh": "看要团体公演还是什么，都随便你们吧。\n我先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1061_tenkuseiei", "source_sha256": "0a07d711c7ed9ff677eb23795251ee3e6738eb3c904d8cf249d8c390339c41f5", "ja": "ザッ！（通せんぼ）", "zh": "唰！（阻挡去路）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1062_kuroi", "source_sha256": "95f6fbeda3d716251024646c5eb6cbd17d3e6f785716367d247220ca17a0c83a", "ja": "おい、そこのおだんご頭。周りを取り囲んでる、この\n暑苦しい男達をどけろ！　私が帰れないだろうが！？", "zh": "喂，那个包包头，我被围住了，\n快叫这些血气方刚的男人走开！不然我要怎么回去！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1063_031tom", "source_sha256": "260755a2b2707da5ce82b8774787dea7d3fbb5bba84c87f4db76440172beed71", "ja": "あらあら……。まだご自分の立場が、\nよくわかっていないようですね～。", "zh": "哎呀哎呀……\n看来你还不了解自己的立场呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1064_031tom", "source_sha256": "86edefc5ba3e3b5c12092a85191f2123243ba557bd1b972d0634c1a998e501f3", "ja": "私、こう見えて……\nとっても怒ってるんですよ～？", "zh": "别看我这样……\n我可是很生气喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1065_se", "source_sha256": "5d1d800e214054ecab01b099e5a1a152e8bb8bb2df1324f41847d8c70c4859e9", "ja": "ヒョオオオオオ……！", "zh": "飕飕飕飕飕飕……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1066_kuroi", "source_sha256": "1f1c990dbb99f2a168689fa7f2be4c2027c5fcb33e260a86d6ae2828a4826967", "ja": "ぐおっ、おだんご頭から凍てつくような風が……！？\nな、なんだこれはっ！？　どういう仕掛けだ！？", "zh": "唔喔！包包头那边吹来一阵彻骨的寒风……！？\n这、这是怎么一回事！？你们动了什么手脚！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1067_p", "source_sha256": "e9c147b59b7a714ccc1e93eb62d6be1ca8cb2104ad1642d1173030e8b181bea1", "ja": "（それは俺も知りたい……）", "zh": "（关于这个我也很想知道……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1068_031tom", "source_sha256": "0c8f9ab8a68d7077d6e6bcc2daa6270ccc94ee222103252c79fd1ead7ab776ec", "ja": "悪行を為す者は、相応の報いを受けなくては。\n皆さん、存分に思い知らせて上げてくださいね～。", "zh": "为非作歹的人必须接受相对的惩罚。\n各位，请让他好好体会这一点吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1069_tenkuseiei", "source_sha256": "af43f20d56d8b068078b9d72cd5afcae4220320b59439cdbc22d2ede2e14a2fe", "ja": "ザッ！（抱え上げ）", "zh": "唰！（抬起）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1070_kuroi", "source_sha256": "77aeb5a015f85e59516bb7621531be86a253b7ece9e16af4a3c46971a7cc4deb", "ja": "うわ、何をする！？　抱え上げるなと言ってるだろう！\n降ろせ！　今すぐ降ろさないか！？", "zh": "哇！你们做什么！？我叫你们别抬我！\n放我下来！马上放我下来！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1071_tenkuseiei", "source_sha256": "77a6e33084f535514c035d90a4657b539d2dc0bd8be5ec3e6824c51a9300a429", "ja": "ザッザッザッ……（フェードアウト）", "zh": "唰唰唰……（逐渐远去）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1072_kuroi", "source_sha256": "035ec44de06941734e405b84b5d418ef7571f95f80a5a0afe7b9dd61e7cac9c6", "ja": "こ、こらっ、人をどこへ連れて行くつもりだ！？\n一体どこへ……止まれ！　止～ま～る～の～だ～～！！", "zh": "喂、喂！你们要带我去哪里！？\n到底要去哪里……停下来！给～我～停～下～来～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1073_047sub", "source_sha256": "a4f6f813eb5813d46bbae9c6c3f734edc050fdf3e7db6c246b9c2ebedceeaa2d", "ja": "すっげ～。黒井のオッサン、\nなんか胴上げされてるみたいだったよな！", "zh": "好厉害喔～\n黑井大叔好像被他们抛到半空中耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1074_027say", "source_sha256": "9bdea9603a88be0f5e69ef0ade8dc6461afd9026fe73fb435e4ef421eaf4ce1c", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだね。\n少しもおめでたくないけど！", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。\n虽然根本不是庆祝的那种抛人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1075_p", "source_sha256": "76840908a086722873727015f498e50b1e675ab692950c25c68e949b4ac1425f", "ja": "えっと、朋花？\nまさかとは思うけど、その……。", "zh": "那个，朋花？\n虽然我觉得不可能，不过该不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1076_031tom", "source_sha256": "f4a69b2835f76a64c63dcf8710d5c62e9a7bd950444026620dd7e35d396b80f9", "ja": "安心してください。私も、精鋭部隊のみなさんに、\n後ろ暗いことをさせるつもりはありません。", "zh": "请放心吧。\n我也不打算让精锐部队的各位做出见不得人的行为。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1077_031tom", "source_sha256": "dd0bc63cd28095cebb56c04e6f96a0761e0d4a88e207ee2fd6ad5df0ba1b57c2", "ja": "ただ、黒井社長には当分の間、少し遠くに行って\nもらおうと思っているだけです～。うふふ♪", "zh": "我只是要他们让黑井社长\n暂时远离会场罢了～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1078_p", "source_sha256": "cc13a3a734d5f9493aa8a9554dcdb355e588b274b0efa8c5b67d30e6de6d155d", "ja": "そ、そうか……遠くってどこだろうな……。\nまあ、あとで、念のため教えてくれ。", "zh": "这、这样啊……不知道会跑到多远……\n算了，待会你再告诉我，以防万一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1079_047sub", "source_sha256": "063149ebf71d186f23b0e39528c5bc9f357927a827baf21d7a8831516444fce3", "ja": "なあなあ、それよりさ、美希！　さっきの言葉、\nオレ、すっげー感動したよ！　ありがとなっ♪", "zh": "欸欸，别管黑井大叔了，美希！\n你刚刚讲的话，我听了超感动的！谢啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1080_027say", "source_sha256": "78308fd8a23d0773e1d221b2f2f8cad4fb4631669e2af40854bc8e2760df8b6a", "ja": "私達も美希ちゃんのこと大好きだよ！", "zh": "我们也很喜欢美希喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1081_003mik", "source_sha256": "2220ef3ad94972fb8320fc4b2da49cd292049cac5e1aa5a7cab862e6edfbcc29", "ja": "ありがとうなの、昴くん、紗代子！\n{$P$}は？　ミキのこと好き？？", "zh": "谢谢你们唷，阿昴、纱代子！\n{$P$}呢？你喜欢美希吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1082_p", "source_sha256": "77bceb86125a6d1f6c2ba7d8434a149c55d0deca381357af5e53120b67dcfc27", "ja": "ああ。\n美希のことも、みんなのことも大好きだ。", "zh": "嗯嗯。\n我喜欢美希，也喜欢大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1083_003mik", "source_sha256": "ffa01dc1868942a0d7375bd538443d874f1530eb041b015ac7fc1c1914d6d42d", "ja": "あはっ☆　だったら、公演もいっぱい頑張っちゃうね♪\nもっともっと、ミキのこと見て欲しいから！", "zh": "啊哈☆既然这样，那公演也要好好加油了♪\n希望你可以给美希更多、更多的关注！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1084_027say", "source_sha256": "80437bde8b4aad90963bb4746849dfc58401370b673fa51822b4f2bfb76afff8", "ja": "うん！　後は公演だけだもんね……\n全力を振り絞ろう！　ファンのみんなのために！", "zh": "嗯！现在只剩下公演了……\n我们全力以赴吧！为了粉丝们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0024_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_06_1085_p", "source_sha256": "314af8a71886b26c591eebfa97e32ef83bda6726b5bc18078401384976417f56", "ja": "（みんなの心が1つになった。きっとこの後の公演は、\n俺の想像以上に光り輝くステージになるだろう！）", "zh": "（大家团结一心了。接下来的公演，\n一定是场超乎我想像的闪耀表演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
